        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_00">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="94" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>게임을 시작하면 메인 메뉴가 표시됩니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_00">
              <texMap imageName="02_01_u" imageNameLeft="" imageNameRight="" stereoEnabled="false" />
            </material>
            <texEnabled>true</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>RightTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>10</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>4</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>7</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>10</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_01">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="23" y="1" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="249" y="24" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>처음으로 플레이하는 경우</text>
            <topColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Center" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_01" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_02">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="39" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="80" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>｢처음부터 시작｣을 선택합니다. 화면의 지시에 따라 난이도와 게임 모드를 선택하고, 마이 유닛(자신의 분신)의 모습을 설정합니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_02" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_03">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="15" y="13" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="270" y="120" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>난이도 ｢노멀｣을 선택하면 게임 중에 튜토리얼(게임 방법)이 표시됩니다.
다른 난이도에서도 월드 맵의 진격 준비 메뉴(→7)와 시스템 메뉴(→15)에서 튜토리얼을 확인할 수 있습니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_03" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_04">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="23" y="1" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="249" y="24" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>이어서 플레이하는 경우</text>
            <topColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Center" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_04" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_05">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="60" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>재개할 저장 데이터를 선택합니다. 중단 저장 데이터(→3)는 게임을 재개하면 삭제됩니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_05" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_06">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="80" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true" indentEnabled="true" indentText="※">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>&lt;indent/&gt;저장 데이터 선택 시에 하단 화면을 터치하거나,  또는 를 누르면 일반 저장 데이터와 맵 저장 데이터(→3)를 전환할 수 있습니다.</text>
            <topColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_06" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
